# Build-out sessions

Before large feature work, read [`docs/BUILD_OUT.md`](docs/BUILD_OUT.md) and [`docs/plugins.md`](docs/plugins.md).

## Slice rules

- One vertical slice per PR/commit group (API + migration if needed + UI + changelog).
- Prefer extending an existing service or adding a **compose-profiled** service over new frameworks.
- Control adapters implement [`packages/farm.ControlPlane`](packages/farm/plane.go); do not leak backend HTTP types into core/web.
- Commerce, notify, slicer, and future direct-printer paths are **plugins** (optional profiles / adapters), not hard deps of MVP compose.

## Handoff

End of a long session: update the "Session handoff" section in `docs/BUILD_OUT.md` (done / next / blocked).
